Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 12:57:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ant: gnss-crpa package (SMI-PI anti-jam service),
 gnss_loopback forwards to it

package/gnss-crpa builds the Linux port of the SMI-PI v4.9.14 E310
firmware (sources copied in by antsdr-fw-patch/build.sh) and starts it at
boot as S95gnss_crpa; 'gnss' talks to it.
